body:
In the following example, the call to imported `foo()` doesn't get renamed within `notExportedAsync()`. 

Given this module file:

```
export function foo() {
    return;
}
```

And this entry file:

```
import { foo } from './module';
// will transform to: 
// /* harmony import */ var __WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_2__module__ = __webpack_require__(50);

export async function exportedAsync() {
    await foo(); // will rename foo() to __WEBPACK_IMPORTED_MODULE_2__module__["a"].bind()()
}

async function notExportedAsync() {
    foo(); // WILL NOT rename foo() <<<<======
}

export function exportedNotAsync() {
    foo(); // rename OK
}

function notExportedNotAsync() {
    foo(); // rename OK
}
```

